# ios/ is a STUB — not a Capacitor/Xcode project.
#
# Windows cannot create or sync a real iOS app. On a Mac with Xcode:
#
#   npm run build:web
#   npx cap add ios          # once — creates the native project
#   npm run ios:sync         # build:web + cap sync ios
#   npx cap open ios
#
# Attach storekit/Products.storekit to the Xcode scheme
# (Edit Scheme → Run → Options → StoreKit Configuration).
#
# Full checklist: ../CAPACITOR_SHIP.md
# Store leftovers: ../store/ASC_SETUP.md, SCREENSHOTS.md, SUBSCRIPTION_TESTS.md
